musl v1.2.5 math routines, https://git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl/
Only pow/powf and their real tables/error routines are linked.
libm.h adds the private visibility macro supplied by musl features.h.
fp_arch.h is the upstream generic implementation (soft float target).
License and copyrights: COPYRIGHT and individual source headers.
libm.h uses compiler byte-order constants instead of musl endian.h and omits
an unrelated signgam declaration conflicting with the target C headers.
The table headers use libm.h for private visibility instead of musl features.h.
